<section class="section">
  <div class="container">
    <span class="eyebrow">Who we are</span>
    <h2>From individual expertise to collective impact</h2>
    <p>
      Across Germany, data stewards contribute to research in diverse
      roles and institutional settings. Yet their expertise,
      experiences, and challenges often remain fragmented across
      organisational and disciplinary boundaries.
    </p>
    <p>
      DSG brings these perspectives together to build a cohesive,
      empowered, and recognised community.
    </p>
    <p>
      <strong>We believe that data stewardship must have a voice
      wherever decisions about research data, infrastructure,
      policies, and governance are made.</strong>
    </p>
    <p>
      By connecting practical expertise with collective advocacy,
      we work to strengthen the profession and establish data
      stewardship as an integral part of the research landscape.
    </p>
    <a href="/about/">Learn more about DSG →</a>
  </div>
</section>

